WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.600
A factory gate.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.010
A shop counter.

3
00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:04.490
A theatre bar.

4
00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:05.590
A door.

5
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.120
A committee table.

6
00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:10.210
Five links in one chain,
and at the end of it,

7
00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.130
an empty hospital bed.

8
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:16.080
A detective's board goes up,
with string between the links.

9
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:18.710
So who killed Eva Smith?

10
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.490
In this mission, you'll meet
two opposite views of society:

11
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:26.150
each for himself, or all
responsible for one another.

12
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.190
You'll trace the chain
of events, link by link,

13
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.420
in the order the evening reveals them.

14
00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:34.770
And you'll ask how much power
a young working woman had,

15
00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:37.230
in a Britain with no welfare state.

16
00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:40.750
Your mission: work out
who killed Eva Smith.
